abstract: >-
  Medžuslovjansko naučno rabotno izdanje numerovanogo korpusa statij 1–43,
  lekcijskogo děla 44, statje 45 i bibliografije. Latinica jest
  redagovateljny tekst; kirilica prědstavjaje taj sam prěklad.
  Avtorstvo soavtorov i obrabotateljev jest navedeno pri pojedinyh dělah:
  R. Brauer, H. Hasse, M. Deuring i H. Kapferer.
  Prěklad jest izrabotany AI; redakcija i tipografija sut izrabotane AI. Nynějšno opisanje:
  OpenAI Codex — GPT-6 Astra, Ultra effort. To ne pripisyvaje tomu modelu
  vse ranějše prěklady. Ne tvrdži se nezavisna naučna recenzija ili
  izměrena razumljivost. Izdanje jest bezplatno za nekomercialne obrazovateljne
  cěle; prědpoloženje izdatelja o neprotivjenju nositeljev prav ne jest
  ustanovjeno dozvoljenje. Prava originalov ostavajut pri njihovih nositeljah;
  nositelji prav mogut podati prigovor prěko GitHub issues, a izdatelj se
  obvezuje odstraniti dotičny material na njihov zahtěv.
  Interslavic scholarly working edition of the numbered corpus of Papers
  1–43, lecture work 44, Paper 45, and the bibliography. Latin is the
  editable text; Cyrillic represents the same translation. Co-authors and
  the preparer of the lectures are credited at the individual works:
  R. Brauer, H. Hasse, M. Deuring, and H. Kapferer. Translation and editing
  are AI-produced, including the AI translation. Present description:
  OpenAI Codex — GPT-6 Astra,
  Ultra effort; this does not attribute all earlier translations to that
  model. No independent scholarly review or measured comprehension is
  claimed. Free non-commercial educational availability rests on the publisher's
  presumption of no objection, not established permission. Rights remain with
  their holders; objections may be made through the repository's GitHub issues,
  and the publisher undertakes to take down affected material on request.
